                    "Over the past month Levi's, Prada and Dior all released animated holiday campaigns, and all three positioned older techniques, stop-motion and hand-drawn cel animation, against the rise of generated imagery.  Craft as the differentiator.  It is a reasonable strategy this year and three serious brands reached for it at once.",
