                    "So the sequence runs like this.  Build the campaign on a craft claim.  Make behind-the-scenes content to prove the craft claim.  Hand the internet the material it needs to test the craft claim against the finished film.  The process footage was supposed to be the evidence for the defence.  It became the evidence for the prosecution.",
